{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2000.<br>You\u2019ve broken into the long-abandoned <strong>EQUO Research Facility</strong>, mysteriously shut down in 1985. Beneath the ruins, hidden in the underwing, you find <strong>The Mirage</strong> \u2014 an experimental time machine designed to <i>simulate</i> the world as it was. A 'Save File' of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mirage recreates places, not people. It builds a version of the past \u2014 empty, silent, frozen in time.<br>Until you enter it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your presence confuses the system. It starts trying to rebuild life\u2026 but it gets it wrong.<br>Shadows begin to appear. They follow you. They change. They become something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a fractured facility through decades of decay.</strong><br>Travel between timelines. Recover items. Solve puzzles. Uncover what EQUO was hiding \u2014 and what the Mirage is becoming.<br>As you dig deeper, the machine begins to generate new spaces\u2026 spaces that were never real.<br>And the things inside those spaces are starting to remember you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player sci-fi horror story tied to the <i>YouTube series</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through simulated timelines and gather tools from the past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadow-like entities that evolve the longer you stay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden levels created by the Mirage\u2019s growing mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on how far you're willing to go</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729930?t=1763449699","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729930?t=1763449699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s